{"id":"adc7a8154ed79d46","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-positive-measure.md","title":"Positive Measure","display":"df-positive-measure — Positive Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-positive-measure","aliases":["58-df-positive-measure","Positive Measure","58-df-zfc-measure10-positive-set","58-df-zfc-measure9-positive-measure-set"],"display":"df-positive-measure — Positive Measure","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-positive-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-positive-measure</span><span>Positive Measure</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure10-positive-set</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure9-positive-measure-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-positive-measure — Positive Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X, \\mathcal{M})\">\\((X, \\mathcal{M})\\)</span> (measurable space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu,X,\\mathcal M\\in V\">\\(\\mu,X,\\mathcal M\\in V\\)</span> (measure data)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (canonical measure predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PositiveMeasure}_S,\\mathrm{FiniteMeasure}_S,\\mathrm{SigmaFinite}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PositiveMeasure}_S,\\mathrm{FiniteMeasure}_S,\\mathrm{SigmaFinite}_S\\)</span> (measure predicates defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10PositiveSet}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9PositiveMeasureSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10PositiveSet}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9PositiveMeasureSet}_S\\)</span> (alias predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positive\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{PositiveMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positive\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{PositiveMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positive\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{FiniteMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal M) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{PositiveMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal M)\\land \\mu(X)&lt;\\infty\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positive\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{FiniteMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal M) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{PositiveMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal M)\\land \\mu(X)&lt;\\infty\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positive\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{SigmaFinite}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal M) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{PositiveMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal M)\\land \\exists \\langle X_i:i\\in\\omega\\rangle\\in\\mathcal M^\\omega\\;(X = \\bigcup_{i\\in\\omega} X_i \\land \\forall i\\in\\omega\\;\\mu(X_i) &lt; \\infty)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positive\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{SigmaFinite}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal M) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{PositiveMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal M)\\land \\exists \\langle X_i:i\\in\\omega\\rangle\\in\\mathcal M^\\omega\\;(X = \\bigcup_{i\\in\\omega} X_i \\land \\forall i\\in\\omega\\;\\mu(X_i) &lt; \\infty)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positive\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10PositiveSet}_S(A,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow A\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu)\\land\\mu(A)&gt;0\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positive\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10PositiveSet}_S(A,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow A\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu)\\land\\mu(A)&gt;0\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positive\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9PositiveMeasureSet}_S(A,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10PositiveSet}_S(A,\\mu)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positive\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9PositiveMeasureSet}_S(A,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10PositiveSet}_S(A,\\mu)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><code>PositiveMeasure</code> is retained as a historical alias of the canonical nonnegative countably additive measure predicate; positivity of a measurable set is defined separately by the last two aliases.</li>\n<li>Signed measure: takes values in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}\">\\(\\mathbb{R}\\)</span>; allows negative values; Jordan decomposition</li>\n<li>Finite: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(X) &lt; \\infty\">\\(\\mu(X) &lt; \\infty\\)</span>; signed finite <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\implies\">\\(\\implies\\)</span> Hahn decomposition</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-finite: almost every point has finite measure neighborhood; Lebesgue is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-finite</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Halmos, Measure Theory</li>\n<li>Rudin, Real and Complex Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (canonical measure predicate from [[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X, \\mathcal{M})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu,X,\\mathcal M\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PositiveMeasure}_S,\\mathrm{FiniteMeasure}_S,\\mathrm{SigmaFinite}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10PositiveSet}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9PositiveMeasureSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positive\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{PositiveMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal M)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positive\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{FiniteMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal M) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{PositiveMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal M)\\land \\mu(X)<\\infty","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positive\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{SigmaFinite}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal M) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{PositiveMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal M)\\land \\exists \\langle X_i:i\\in\\omega\\rangle\\in\\mathcal M^\\omega\\;(X = \\bigcup_{i\\in\\omega} X_i \\land \\forall i\\in\\omega\\;\\mu(X_i) < \\infty)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positive\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10PositiveSet}_S(A,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow A\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu)\\land\\mu(A)>0","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positive\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9PositiveMeasureSet}_S(A,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10PositiveSet}_S(A,\\mu)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb{R}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu(X) < \\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\implies","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false}],"bytes":2336,"backlinks":[{"id":"ef103f0303462b75","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fcde8ed3b263861a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-969","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-positive-measure.md|58-df-positive-measure]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["ca832ed6bc22f728"]}